<figure class="test-harness" aria-labelledby="test-harness-caption">
  <div class="brief"><span class="label">You define the DUT</span><strong>Past projects + written differences + framework documentation</strong></div>
  <div class="flow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
  <div class="harness">
