      <div><strong>Non-hardware checks</strong><span>Python syntax and configuration validity; no instrument connections</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
  <div class="brief"><span class="label">You review and test</span><strong>Review files → test on real instruments → return logs and observations</strong></div>
